      "final_chatbot_response": "Based on the information provided in the course material chunks, it seems like your research should align with research ethics principles to ensure the protection of participants and data. Key considerations include obtaining informed consent, ensuring voluntary participation, maintaining privacy and confidentiality, handling data securely, minimizing harm, being transparent about the research purpose and data use, and using AI or automated tools responsibly.\n\nBefore proceeding with your research, make sure to plan for ethics considerations, collect only necessary data, protect participants, and be transparent about how the data will be used. Additionally, it's important to avoid collecting sensitive or unnecessary personal data unless absolutely required for your research objectives.\n\nIf you have specific details about your research that you would like feedback on, feel free to provide more context or details for further guidance.",
