      "final_chatbot_response": "After collecting your survey responses, the next step would be to organize and prepare the data for analysis. This involves checking the completeness of the data, correcting any obvious errors, handling duplicates, applying consistent coding, anonymizing data if necessary, and documenting your decisions. For qualitative recordings, you may need to transcribe and anonymize them, while survey data may require coding into consistent categories. \n\nOnce you have organized the data, you can proceed with the formal analysis. Make sure to preserve the raw evidence, clean the data systematically, anonymize where needed, and document any transformations made so that your analysis remains traceable. This process will help you make sense of the responses you have collected and draw meaningful conclusions from your survey data.",
